-mfb (Fast Bytes)
─────────────────
Range: 5 – 273
Higher = the compressor tries harder to find
optimal matches. 273 is the maximum and gives
the best ratio but is slower.
For most use cases, 64–128 is a good balance.
273 is for when you want absolute best ratio
